        "es": "Gula",
        "en": "Gluttony"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Cuando sus PS se ven reducidos a la mitad, engulle la baya que normalmente solo se comería cuando le quedasen pocos PS.",
        "en": "This Pokémon eats any held Berry triggered by low HP when it falls below 50% of its HP, regardless of the Berry's usual threshold."
      }
    },
    {
      "is_hidden": false,
      "name": {
        "es": "Entusiasmo",
        "en": "Hustle"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Aumenta su Ataque, pero reduce su Precisión.",
        "en": "This Pokémon's physical moves do 1.5× as much regular damage, but have 0.8× their usual accuracy. Special moves are unaffected. Moves that do set damage, such as Seismic Toss, have their accuracy affected, but not their damage. Overworld: If the lead Pokémon has this ability, higher-levelled Pokémon have their encounter rate increased."
      }
    },
    {
      "is_hidden": true,
      "name": {
        "es": "Sebo",
        "en": "Thick Fat"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Gracias a la gruesa capa de grasa que lo protege, reduce a la mitad el daño que recibe de ataques de tipo Fuego o Hielo.",
        "en": "This Pokémon takes half as much damage from Fire- and Ice-type moves."
      }
    }
